                                                "sense_id": "34773773-1797-3d49-8e03-b8051cf62164",
                                                "text": "A nanobullet comprising of multifunctional Janus nanocomposites (a head of magnetic Fe₃O₄ and a body of mesoporous SiO₂ containing doxorubicin) is reported to be a safe and efﬁcient treatment for liver cancer."
